n0xis signature libraries — upstream attributions
==================================================

The signature databases in this tree are generated by `n0xis sig gen` from the
open-source libraries listed below, each built from its own published source.
The signatures are functional fingerprints (leading bytes with relocated bytes
wildcarded) used only to identify a function by name; each corpus is provided
under, and subject to, its upstream library's license, reproduced/attributed
here. They are NOT derived from the signature databases shipped with any other reverse-engineering tool.

